abstract: >-
  The IfThenWhy™ framework is a thought leadership protocol that prioritizes Strategic Intent over Technical Infrastructure. 
  It utilizes a 6-file metadata architecture (MAN, SEM, BRG, LDD, DIC, LUT) to ensure every data action (The Then) is 
  physically bonded to a business purpose (The Why)[cite: 2, 3]. This architecture provides the deterministic 
  grounding required for AI agentic reasoning and formal benchmarking standards.
